<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">收件地址</view>
    <view wx:if="{{address}}" bindtap="goChooseAddress">
      <view>{{address.consigner}} {{address.mobile}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{address.province}}{{address.city}}{{address.district}}{{address.address}}</view>
    </view>
    <button wx:else class="btn-outline" bindtap="goChooseAddress">选择/添加收件地址</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">选择包裹</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!packages.length}}" class="muted">
      没有可下单的包裹。包裹寄到日本仓、仓库签收称重之后，才能在这里选中发货。
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="id" class="row" style="padding: 12rpx 0; border-top: 1rpx solid #f0f0f0;"
      data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onTogglePackage">
      <checkbox checked="{{selectedIds.indexOf(item.id) > -1}}" />
      <view style="flex: 1; margin-left: 12rpx;">
        <view>{{item.good_name}}</view>
        <view class="muted">
          实测 {{item.actual_weight}}kg · ¥{{item.price}}<block wx:if="{{item.photoCharged}}"> · 含入库拍照</block>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">物流线路</view>
    <picker range="{{lines}}" range-key="name" bindchange="onLineChange">
      <view class="input row">
        <view>{{selectedLineName}}</view>
        <view class="muted">点击切换</view>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{selectedLine}}">{{selectedLine.price_text}}</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{selectedLine}}">
      {{selectedLine.value_range}} · {{selectedLine.days_min}}-{{selectedLine.days_max}}天
    </view>
    <view class="hint" style="margin: 12rpx 0 0;">
      这一单申报价值约 ¥{{declaredValue}}。两条线都能选，价值高的走「无忧草」更稳妥。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">备注</view>
    <input class="input" placeholder="给客服的备注（选填）" value="{{remark}}" bindinput="onRemarkInput" />
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">费用明细</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!fees.length}}" class="muted">选好包裹和线路后，这里会列出每一笔钱怎么算的</view>
    <view wx:for="{{fees}}" wx:key="fee_type" class="fee-row">
      <view class="fee-name">
        <view>{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="fee-detail">{{item.detail}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="fee-amount">¥{{item.amount}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="fee-total" wx:if="{{fees.length}}">
      <view>合计（计费重量 {{totalWeight}}kg）</view>
      <view class="fee-total-amount">¥{{totalFee}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSubmit">提交订单</button>
</view>
